Answer:
17. 命题透析 本题考查线线垂直的证明、棱锥的体积及空间向量的应用.

解析 (1)因为$A_{1}C \perp$平面$AB_{1}C_{1}$,$B_{1}C_{1} \subset$平面$AB_{1}C_{1}$,
所以$A_{1}C \perp B_{1}C_{1}$. \tag{1分}
易知$B_{1}C_{1} \perp CC_{1}$,
又$CC_{1} \cap A_{1}C=C$,$CC_{1} \subset$平面$A_{1}CC_{1}$,$A_{1}C \subset$平面$A_{1}CC_{1}$,

所以$B_{1}C_{1} \perp$平面$A_{1}CC_{1}$. \tag{3分}
由$A_{1}C_{1} \subset$平面$A_{1}CC_{1}$,可知$B_{1}C_{1} \perp A_{1}C_{1}$. \tag{4分}

(2)由$A_{1}C \perp$平面$AB_{1}C_{1}$,$AC_{1} \subset$平面$AB_{1}C_{1}$,可知$A_{1}C \perp AC_{1}$, \tag{5分}
又四边形$AA_{1}C_{1}C$是矩形,故四边形$AA_{1}C_{1}C$是正方形,则$A_{1}C_{1}=AA_{1}=2$, \tag{6分}
所以$V_{C_{1}-AA_{1}B_{1}}=V_{A-A_{1}B_{1}C_{1}}=\frac{1}{3} \cdot AA_{1} \cdot S_{\triangle A_{1}B_{1}C_{1}}=\frac{1}{3} \times 2 \times \frac{1}{2} \times 2 \times 1=\frac{2}{3}$,
即三棱锥$C_{1}-AA_{1}B_{1}$的体积为$\frac{2}{3}$. \tag{9分}

(3)方法一:以$C_{1}$为坐标原点,直线$C_{1}B_{1}$,$C_{1}A_{1}$,$C_{1}C$分别为$x$轴、$y$轴、$z$轴建立如图所示的空间直角坐标系$C_{1}xyz$,则$B_{1}(1,0,0)$,$C(0,0,2)$,$A_{1}(0,2,0)$,
故$\overrightarrow{B_{1}C}=(-1,0,2)$. \tag{11分}
易知平面$AB_{1}C_{1}$的一个法向量为$\overrightarrow{A_{1}C}=(0,-2,2)$. \tag{12分}
设直线$B_{1}C$与平面$AB_{1}C_{1}$所成的角为$\theta$,
则$\sin\theta=\frac{|\overrightarrow{B_{1}C} \cdot \overrightarrow{A_{1}C}|}{|\overrightarrow{B_{1}C}||\overrightarrow{A_{1}C}|}=\frac{4}{\sqrt{5} \times 2\sqrt{2}}=\frac{\sqrt{10}}{5}$,
即直线$B_{1}C$与平面$AB_{1}C_{1}$所成角的正弦值为$\frac{\sqrt{10}}{5}$. \tag{15分}

方法二:设$A_{1}C$与$AC_{1}$交于点$M$.
$\because A_{1}C \perp$平面$AB_{1}C_{1}$,
$\therefore CM \perp$平面$AB_{1}C_{1}$. \tag{11分}
连接$B_{1}M$,则$\angle CB_{1}M$即为直线$B_{1}C$与平面$AB_{1}C_{1}$所成的角.
$\because$四边形$AA_{1}C_{1}C$是边长为2的正方形,
$\therefore A_{1}C=\sqrt{AC^{2}+AA_{1}^{2}}=\sqrt{2^{2}+2^{2}}=2\sqrt{2}$,则$CM=\sqrt{2}$. \tag{13分}
又$B_{1}C=\sqrt{BC^{2}+BB_{1}^{2}}=\sqrt{1^{2}+2^{2}}=\sqrt{5}$,
$\therefore \sin\angle CB_{1}M=\frac{CM}{CB_{1}}=\frac{\sqrt{2}}{\sqrt{5}}=\frac{\sqrt{10}}{5}$,
即直线$B_{1}C$与平面$AB_{1}C_{1}$所成角的正弦值为$\frac{\sqrt{10}}{5}$. \tag{15分}

